{"tool":"medusa.admin_post","args":{"path":"/admin/research/artifacts","body":{"record_type":"report","scope_id":"rscope_colander_de","save_key":"market-blocked-de-2026-10-04","schema_revision":"market_research/1","report_kind":"market_research","skill_revision":"intgral-research/market@2","runbook_revision":"intgral-research@4","template_revision":"market_research@1","markdown":"# 折叠硅胶沥水篮 – Amazon 德国站市场研究\n\n## 决策和范围\n\n**市场**: amazon.de\n**产品类别**: 折叠硅胶沥水篮\n**采样期**: 2026-10-04\n**决策问题**: 折叠硅胶沥水篮在 Amazon 德国站是否值得探索？\n\n## 采集状态\n\n**阻止原因**: 本部署不支持来自 amazon.de 的数据采集。\n\n当前配置的支持的能力和数据源对如下：\n- `amazon.discovery` + `amazon_es`（西班牙）\n- `amazon.reviews` + `amazon_es`（西班牙）\n- `alibaba.product_discovery` 和 `alibaba.supplier_discovery`（国际运往 ES）\n- `ad_video.discovery`（Meta 和 TikTok 广告库）\n\n**技术错误**: `unsupported_research_capability` – amazon.discovery x amazon_de\n\n## 建议选项\n\n1. **采集 Amazon 西班牙站（amazon.es）** 的相同产品\n2. **请求部署启用** 对 Amazon 德国站（amazon.de）的支持\n3. **在 Alibaba** 上采集原型供应商信息\n\n## 消耗的资源\n\n- 请求数: 0\n- 结果数: 0\n- 运行时间: 0 ms\n- 预算消耗: 0 USD（预算上限: 10 USD）","data":{"scope_decision":{"market":"amazon.de","category":"folding silicone drain baskets","period":"2026-10-04","decision_question":"Is a folding silicone drain basket worth exploring on Amazon Germany?"},"source_selection":[],"measured_metrics":{"market_size":null,"sales":null,"growth":null},"demand_hypotheses":[{"text":"Acquisition from amazon.de was requested but this deployment does not support Amazon Germany. The error code unsupported_research_capability was returned.","basis":"unknown","evidence_ids":[]}],"trend_gaps":[{"text":"No acquisition attempted; no evidence collected.","basis":"unknown","evidence_ids":[]}],"competition_prices":[],"opportunities":[]},"coverage":{"status":"blocked","gaps":["amazon.de data source not supported in current deployment","no evidence collected","no market measurements available"]}}},"isError":false,"response":{"status":201,"ok":true,"body":{"artifact":{"id":"rart_report_col_de_m